{"html": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/4466f77c0b6600ba9de815e35e2559ef.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/4466f77c0b6600ba9de815e35e2559ef.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's FREE to Play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for stylish action and a variety of customization options.<br>Feel the thrill of lightning-fast combat that blurs the line between close and long-range action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You’ll be able to pull off all kinds of wild moves with fluid movement and strategic use of the environment.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle pushes the boundaries of what you’ve experienced in the game – intense, bold, and full of action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/6110e30c6102ca10caa36406929a702e.poster.avif?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/d72bdfa4dfafc53e6e37a8c86a482a13.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/d72bdfa4dfafc53e6e37a8c86a482a13.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It’s time to awaken your combat instincts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legendary gladiators of GunZ offer more than just simple gunfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With wall-running, acrobatic air combat, dashes, and a mix of close and long-range weapons, the action offers unlimited freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train your own fighting style, keep fighting, and seize your glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/62115b254cd5a5cef48feb07eae45241.poster.avif?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/4f04859623bb8f3d61de5a6ccd1f674b.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/4f04859623bb8f3d61de5a6ccd1f674b.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a more immersive world with enhanced graphics and UI, all while preserving the classic feel and controls you loved!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/491aecc646f036aafbcd375a7cccd793.poster.avif?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/1f6e1a0db63834deb5b107ec17803b5e.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/1f6e1a0db63834deb5b107ec17803b5e.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An extensive collection of permanent character customization parts, as well as weapon components and action effects, is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your individuality with endless customization possibilities, free from “equipment” restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/9ac150fb8e473f391e385fe8ddf19967.poster.avif?t=1786696577\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/f2c72bcdae092ad10be81fa52629fd29.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/f2c72bcdae092ad10be81fa52629fd29.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GunZ delivers more than just PvP – embark on epic PvE adventures where you face formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with your allies and dive into massive threats together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in epic boss fights and embark on numerous quests filled with adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&nbsp;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras/497767835afcee9965d767cbc2bc35b1.avif?t=1786696577\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139440/extras_big/497767835afcee9965d767cbc2bc35b1.webp?t=1786696577\"></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Official tournaments will be held regularly to find the ultimate contender for the title of strongest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the opportunity to show off your and your allies' impressive skills to all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unite with your team, break down the barrier, and secure your place in the Hall of Fame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The throne stands ready, waiting for you to ascend and claim it as your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Future update coming soon!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Add to Your Wishlist and prepare for battle!</i></p>"}